Description:

The HTTP server now escapes the client-supplied Host header before placing
it in an HTML response body.  Two responses carried it: the page that sends
a cleartext request to HTTPS when :imapdconf:`tls_required` is set, and the
footer of the generic error page.  Previously the value was reflected
verbatim, permitting reflected cross-site scripting.


